{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Meat Company Commander, faced with a series of missions. You have five Veterans at your disposal, each with a different set of skills. Each completed mission grants you new abilities to deploy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat against overwhelming numbers of Bunglings (enemies) allows for a variety of tactics. Friendly fire, magic potions, and interactive board elements add variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire action is set in a unique fantasy world, with stylized stop-motion animation and a story with a sense of humor. As the Meat Company Commander, how many veterans will you sacrifice to complete the mission? Or are you good enough to ensure everyone survives?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852180?t=1759265664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852180?t=1759265664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852180/98f1576080bc69d90cbc7579a0c743be15c89229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759265664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852180/98f1576080bc69d90cbc7579a0c743be15c89229/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759265664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Meat Company Commander, faced with a series of missions. You have five Veterans at your disposal, each with a different set of skills. Each completed mission grants you new abilities to deploy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat against overwhelming numbers of Bunglings (enemies) allows for a variety of tactics. Friendly fire, magic potions, and interactive board elements add variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire action is set in a unique fantasy world, with stylized stop-motion animation and a story with a sense of humor. As the Meat Company Commander, how many veterans will you sacrifice to complete the mission? Or are you good enough to ensure everyone survives?</p>","developers":["Jakub Nejman"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852180/3fbc4c0f286b769e14d3dd093269bb9031a9c59b/header.jpg?t=1759265664","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852180/419792390/4a743ae856c7d13717a84ae13bb8d00d656c56a8/1754411424/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754412416","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852180/419792390/4a743ae856c7d13717a84ae13bb8d00d656c56a8/1754411424/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754412416","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852180/419792390/4a743ae856c7d13717a84ae13bb8d00d656c56a8/1754411424/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754412416","id":257171199,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171199/movie480.mp4?t=1754412416","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171199/movie_max.mp4?t=1754412416"},"name":"Hexateria","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s